First, read the file "Guidebook" that should have come with your
NetHack distribution. If you don't have it, ftp to ftp.krl.caltech.edu
and get a file from the /pub/nethack/Guidebook directory.

If you want small hints, get the file /pub/nethack/README, and look at
this file to see what other files in /pub/nethack DON'T have spoilers
in them. A good file for starters is the file /pub/nethack/beginner.tip.

I hope this helps. There are lots more files on ftp.krl.caltech.edu,
but most contain lots of spoilers, which you might not want to read at
first, because, as the name implies, they might spoil the game for you.
All files containing spoilers are marked with an * in the README file.

